Health mandates-CDC and WHO jurisdiction in
HB0141
Wyoming.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lucas, Angelos, Brown, G, Hoeft,
Johnson, Kelly, McCann, Styvar, Wasserburger, Webber
and Wharff and Senator(s) Pearson
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; prohibiting health mandates and
requirements for COVID-19 and any variant thereof by specified federal and
nongovernmental health organizations; and providing for an effective date.
